  "_note": "The Hindi a teacher actually says in an FLN classroom. This is the input to tools/build_pack.mjs, which sends each line to Bhashini for translation and audio. Keep it small and real: a bounded phrasebook that is correct beats an open translator that is wrong. Add a line here, rerun the generator, and it appears in the app.",
  "_nipun": {
    "FL-OL": "Foundational Literacy, oral language",
